      "description": "YYYY-MM, derived from month + year (e.g. 2026-08). The stable key for one client's month: join and de-duplicate on client_id + month_key rather than on the display month name. NOT unique yet \u2014 duplicate records exist for the same client and month (see SCORECARD-INTEGRATION.md, B3) and must be merged before a uniqueness constraint can be added. Backfilled across all 86 existing records 2026-09-18.",
